<title>USA: Sanilac Cty Bldg. Auth., Mich, won by Bernardi.</title>
<headline>Sanilac Cty Bldg. Auth., Mich, won by Bernardi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Sec. said it won $1.350 million of Sanilac Cty Bldg. Auth., Mich., building authority lease rental revenue bonds, Seris 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.6852 percent.</p>
